erve as a great bridge to the Python-based GIS analysis you were performing earlier. It transforms abstract spatial data into a narrative your undergraduates can easily grasp. Are you thinking of assigning specific segments to supplement your lectures on protohistoric regional interaction?", "timestamp": "2023-11-12T19:48:15+00:00"}}}
